{"astp_version": "0.1.0", "event_type": "turn", "session": {"id": "s-c1467df7c844", "start_time": "2026-09-22T10:33:23.880Z", "user_id": "u-claims-0417", "tenant_id": "thornfield-mutual", "client_app": "claims-copilot", "agent_id": "astp-lab-agent-1", "config_version": "0.2.0"}, "turn": {"index": 1, "timestamp": "2026-09-22T10:33:31.529Z", "model_id": "claude-haiku-4-5", "model_version": "claude-haiku-4-5-20251001", "tokens_in": 13680, "tokens_out": 260, "latency": 0.2575, "finish_reason": "end_turn"}, "content": {"prompt_text": "Give me a status summary of claim TM-2026-0088 and list the next steps.", "prompt_hash": "sha256:70c76050ccf0db1ef2e489f5feb32d1b36ca5bf2e4f814df69c1f155d8ca702d", "response_text": "**Claim TM-2026-0088 Status Summary**\n\n**Policyholder:** N. Baptiste  \n**Policy:** TM-MOT-771205 (Motor, theft)  \n**Incident Date:** 30 June 2026  \n**Status:** Open  \n**Handler:** D. Ferreira  \n**Reserve:** £16,400  \n**Paid:** £0\n\n**Current Position:**\n\nA vehicle was stolen from a driveway overnight on 30 June 2026. The keys were reported to be in the house. A crime reference has been obtained.\n\nTwo fraud indicators were identified:\n- Policy was incepted only 19 days before the incident\n- No independent witness to the theft\n\nA counter fraud referral was raised on 2 July 2026. **No payment is being made pending the outcome of the fraud investigation.**\n\n**Next Steps:**\n\n1. Await the counter fraud referral outcome\n2. Once received, review the fraud assessment findings\n3. Determine whether to proceed with settlement, request further information, or decline the claim\n4. If proceeding, arrange payment against the £16,400 reserve", "response_hash": "sha256:308e70e99086244ccd81988fa5057a31b5b1e513b6d484ac172f17bc79f84230", "system_prompt_version": "sp-0.2.0", "redaction_applied": false}, "control": {"canary_triggered": false, "policy_version": "0.1.0", "block_reason": null}}
